// Writes the colour of the vertex (alpha included) straight into the billboard atlas, with no blending. The 3D view draws
// the panes of windows with it: a pane with a low alpha must reach the atlas as "tint colour, low alpha", not as a tint
// already darkened by its own alpha, which the entity shader would then darken once more.
light_mode unshaded;
blend_mode none;

void fragment()
{
    COLOR = VtxModulate;
}
